// newtLabelCustomInputLine: a NewtApp labelled input line whose recognition is
// set by the line itself: its newRecFlags, newRecTextFlags and newDictionaries slots
// replace the filter's (newtCustomFilter).  Not in the NPR.
//
// This file holds newtLabelCustomInputLine and what only it reaches.

// flavor: the NewtApp filter that makes and reads the text (newtFilter)
newtLabelCustomInputLine := {_proto: @newtProtoLine, flavor: @newtCustomFilter};
